Hydrogen Bonds are Coded as N.IJK Where N       = Sequence Number of Hydrogen Bond (NOTE: New Hbond Numbering system)
                                        I - 5   = Nr of Translation Units Along A-Axis
                                        J - 5   = Nr of Translation Units Along B-Axis
                                        K - 5   = Nr of Translation Units Along C-Axis

